(text "NOTES. A concept drawn by Claude at Bob Drzyzgula's direction, October 2026: not built, not tested, values not checked." (at 20.32 257.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c097d69d-b38e-42ac-9870-0e4c1698726e))
(text "1. After Freescale AN1662: zero-cross interrupt starts a timer; at the firing delay a ~100 us gate pulse fires the triac; hand-wheel period by" (at 20.32 260.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 13a35018-8af7-4e7d-80a7-f5ee6fad60db))
(text "   input capture; speed loop every half-cycle (120 Hz); stall watchdog. Added: full isolation, motor-enable relay, operator inputs." (at 20.32 263.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 354d15cd-a13d-448d-896b-5c379d1fe9f8))
(text "2. Pins: FIRE D3/PB0 (TIM3_CH3 one-pulse); RELAY D4/PB7 (SB2 off); ZC D5/PA15 (SB3 off, EXTI); HALL D6/PB6 (TIM4_CH1 capture);" (at 20.32 266.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid faf71671-d3e3-494f-bbe7-aeea8510f1d5))
(text "   STITCH D9/PA8; NEEDLE D11/PB5; A0-A3 knee, pedal, FSR, limit. D0/D1 left for the ST-LINK COM port. Check against the datasheet." (at 20.32 269.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid edb5d43b-712f-46f3-ba54-a5766c224c9a))
(text "3. PS1 feeds CN3-4 (+5V): the ST-LINK is then unpowered (UM2397). Program and debug over USB with the mains unplugged, or via a USB isolator." (at 20.32 273.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid deecea01-92da-4b1c-87da-61cd3d37a6ff))
(text "4. Fire only after a zero-cross has been seen and the command is zero; close K1 last and open it first. Never scope the line side." (at 20.32 276.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4f7ecfd3-6054-44a4-9782-73b72b39eb05))
(text "5. R7/R8: ~3.9 mA peak in the H11AA1; R11: ~8 mA into U3 from 3.3 V; R6/C2 fitted only if a snubberless triac false-fires." (at 20.32 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d0c89622-e235-45d7-be3c-ed9d282cc9c6))
